  "notes": "\u00a9 1990 Sire Records Company\nMade in U.S.A.\n\nRunning time is approximately 58 minutes.\n\nTrack 8 is a spoken word piece by Jello Biafra.\nJello Biafra gives a performance art like routine by marching with an American flag, sucking his thumb and giving a Nazi salute during The Land Of Rape And Honey, but offers no vocal contributions to the track at all.\n\nAside being footage of a concert, it is also interspersed with portions of the group's music videos.",
